== ui_card "Sortable List Helper"
  p The <code>ui_sortable_list</code> helper creates a drag-and-drop sortable list connected to a backend endpoint.
  
  h4 Usage
  pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px;"
    code
      | == ui_sortable_list url: "/sort/endpoint" do
          - items.each do |item|
            == ui_sortable_item item.id do
              = item.title

  h4 Example
  == ui_sortable_list url: "#"
    == ui_sortable_item 1
      span Item 1
    == ui_sortable_item 2
      span Item 2
    == ui_sortable_item 3
      span Item 3
